D_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled as  deep margin   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm piece of oriented breast tissue with a stitch designating a new margin  The new margin is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1   LEFT AXILLARY SENTINEL NODE S    THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF CARCINOMA  Amendment  1  Corrected typographical error in the report note  This report was amended to correct a minor typographical error in the report note  The sentinel lymph node was previously referred to as part A and this has been corrected to part B  The breast excision was previously referred to as part B and this has been corrected to part A  The previously reported diagnoses and interpretations remain unchanged  Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M D   on Tuesday REMOVED_MONTH 01   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 02 59 06PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  Amendment  1 by Ronald Balassanian M D   Electronically signed on Tuesday REMOVED_MONTH 01   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 03 24 06PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Breast  Left   Excision PART B  Lymph Node  Left Axilla   Sentinel    Excision PART C  Breast  Left Infeior  Final Margin   Excision PART D  Breast  Left Superior  Final Margin   Excision PART E  Breast  Left Lateral  Final Margin   Excision PART F  Breast  Left Anterior  Final Margin   Excisio  report_end  , Unchecked.
