ith anterior and posterior margins in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Upper outer quadrant  with posterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lower outer quadrant  with posterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lower inner quadrant  with posterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and anterior margin  in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mid breast    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Separately received fibrofatty tissue     B  Received in formalin  labeled  right nipple specimen   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm tan pink rubbery tissue  which is submitted in toto as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      Received are 2 containers which are  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN     C  Received fresh  labeled  left breast  long   lateral  short   superior   is  a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  nipple sparing mastectomy specimen  with a short stitch  designating superior and a long stitch designating lateral  The anterior  margin is inked blue  and the posterior margin is inked black  There is a REMOVED_DATE  cm in greatest diameter defect  extending from the anterior surface to the  posterior surface  with a hemorrhagic  friable  granular lining  within the  lower outer quadrant  Sectioning reveals that the aforementioned cavity  measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  The surrounding tissue consists of dense   gray white  focally cystic  fibrous tissue   The remaining tissue consists of  gray white  fibrous tissue  admixed with soft  yellow  lobulated adipose  tissue  Lymph nodes are not detected within the lateral tissue  Also received  within the specimen container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm aggregate of unremarkable  fibrofatty tissue  Representative sections are submitted as follows      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Cavity  to include closest anterior margin in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and closest  posterior margin in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    